WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.464 --> 00:00:02.020
- [Voiceover] It's election season again.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.367
We've already had multiple debates,

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:05.340
so the big day must be just
around the corner right?

00:00:05.898 --> 00:00:06.554
Wrong.

00:00:06.554 --> 00:00:09.944
Election Day 2016 is November 8, 2016.

00:00:09.944 --> 00:00:12.707
That's 366 days away.

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:14.187
Let's put that number in perspective.

00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:18.297
The 2015 NFL season from kick-off
to Super Bowl is 150 days.

00:00:18.297 --> 00:00:20.851
That means almost 2 1/2
seasons can fill the space

00:00:20.851 --> 00:00:22.105
before the next election.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:23.869
Any bones broken during this season take

00:00:23.869 --> 00:00:25.750
on average six to twelve weeks to heal,

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.468
which means you could consecutively break

00:00:27.468 --> 00:00:29.976
and heal four different
bones before next November.

00:00:29.976 --> 00:00:31.973
Okay, so let's talk gestation periods.

00:00:31.973 --> 00:00:34.713
A human pregnancy lasts about 280 days.

00:00:34.713 --> 00:00:37.081
A baby conceived today would
be nearly three months old

00:00:37.081 --> 00:00:38.196
on Election Day.

00:00:38.196 --> 00:00:39.937
Even llamas who take their sweet time,

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:42.537
with a gestation period of up to 360 days,

00:00:42.537 --> 00:00:44.534
if they get started now,
they could still pump one out

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:45.347
before the vote.

00:00:45.347 --> 00:00:47.483
Fruit flies have a lifespan about 30 days.

00:00:47.483 --> 00:00:50.362
That's around 12 generations
between now and Election Day.

00:00:50.362 --> 00:00:52.731
In human time, that'd be almost 300 years.

00:00:52.731 --> 00:00:54.774
Alright, forget the
Earth. Let's go to space.

00:00:54.774 --> 00:00:56.724
The Apollo 11 mission went to the moon

00:00:56.724 --> 00:00:58.373
and back in eight days.

00:00:58.373 --> 00:01:01.949
366 days would accommodate 45 trips.

00:01:01.949 --> 00:01:03.017
Forget the moon.

00:01:03.017 --> 00:01:06.755
NASA's rover Curiosity made
it to Mars in 252 days.

00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:08.705
That's more than 100 days
less than it will take

00:01:08.705 --> 00:01:10.772
for us to know the next
leader of the free world.

00:01:10.772 --> 00:01:13.094
Last month, Canada finished
its longest federal election

00:01:13.094 --> 00:01:14.951
campaign since 1872.

00:01:14.951 --> 00:01:15.903
So how long was it?

00:01:15.903 --> 00:01:17.436
78 days.

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:19.258
So chill out, America.

00:01:19.258 --> 00:01:20.809
We've got time.

